# Loaded by Vite only under `--mode measure` (`vite build --mode measure`, this repo's own
# `build:frontend:measure` npm script -- RESIDENCY-PREREGISTRATION.md §12 Amendment 16, viewport-
# residency cut P3r). Widens `isInstrumentedBuild()` (src/isInstrumentedBuild.ts) to `true` under a
# release-optimized (minified, `import.meta.env.DEV === false`) build, keeping the E2E/instrument
# hook gate sites this piece touched COMPILED IN for exactly this one build class -- never loaded
# by `npm run dev`/`npm run build` (plain modes), never a shipped default (docs/09).
VITE_MEASURE_BUILD=1
